			<description>TIER 4 - High Tech
&gt;&gt;&gt; Optimal	Workshops
&gt;&gt; Suitable	Tools
X Inadvisable 	Economy

Tools Recommended: Building, Tree-Cutting, Cooking
Notes: Corrosion-resistant, Superalloy

Stellite is a superalloy of cobalt and chromium, an important material for turbines, rocket engines and other applications that require performance in extreme conditions. Though not exceptionally feasible from an economic standpoint, lathes and workbenches operate at peak efficienty with this material, and it makes decent hammers and other tools.</description>
